      "date": "2026-11-04 09:05:09.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 2: Verified+1\n\nPassed enforced test review-ldiskfs-dne-arm on RHEL 8.10 / x86_64, Rocky 9.8 / aarch64 uploaded by Onyx Autotest from onyx-180vm41: https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/b3a1c6e5-285a-406e-b844-5a8366bd7777 ran 5 tests.",
