        "status": "Contact Oleg Drokin (green@whamcloud.com) with any questions on this account"
      },
      "date": "2026-11-04 09:09:01.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 2:\n\n(4 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nSome concerns, see inline comments. The conversion leaves three `#ifdef CONFIG_LUSTRE_FS_SERVER` sites in mgc (`mgc_internal.h` twice and `do_config_log_add()`/`config_log_add()` in `mgc_request.c`) that are tied to blocks this patch switched to `IS_ENABLED()`. Autoconf builds define both CONFIG_LUSTRE_FS_SERVER and CONFIG_LUSTRE_FS_SERVER_MODULE, so they are unaffected. In the Kbuild =m case this patch is for, only the _MODULE symbol is defined, and the mixed guards break the build and drop the server-only config logs.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 2
    },
